      },
      "text": "Data type:\n  ├── Counts (absolute values): population, cases, dollars\n  ├── Rates (normalized values): per capita, per km², percentages\n  ├── Ratios: unemployment rate, infection rate\n  ├── Categorical: land use type, party affiliation, biome\n  └── Continuous field: temperature, elevation, density"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-THEMATIC-MAPS.md#006",
