        "title": "06 - Thematic Maps",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Geographic aggregation:\n  ├── Points: individual locations (addresses, events)\n  ├── Lines: flows, routes, connections\n  ├── Polygons: administrative units (counties, countries)\n  └── Continuous surface: raster, interpolated field"
    },
