      "text": "## John Snow's Cholera Map (1854)"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-THEMATIC-MAPS.md#011",
      "path": [
        "06-THEMATIC-MAPS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
